 ABC-SMC       R0      4          100        1.4934         0.5553

Nominal is 95%. The informative pattern here is WIDE intervals for
crate and ptran alongside a NARROW interval for beta, all with good
coverage. That is a correctly calibrated posterior reporting an
identifiability limit. NelderMead, DE and BiLSTM cannot appear in
this table at all -- that capability gap is a finding, not a caveat.

